3. Update `channelID` and `readAPIKey`
4. Schedule to run every 30 minutes via **Time Control**

## Troubleshooting

| Issue | Solution |
|---|---|
| ESP32 WiFi not connecting | Check SSID/password; ensure 2.4GHz band |
| Soil readings always 100% or 0% | Calibrate SOIL_DRY_VALUE and SOIL_WET_VALUE |
| ThingSpeak upload returns 0 | Check write API key; rate limit is 15s minimum |
| DHT22 read failed | Verify pull-up resistor; try 1s delay after begin() |
| ML model not found | Run `python src/python/irrigation_model.py` first |
| Email not sending | Use Gmail App Password, not account password |

